&lt;p&gt;🚀 React Day Berlin is back with its &lt;strong&gt;AI for React developers edition!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Build Apps, Not Walls (For AI Era)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is the premier destination for engineers who don’t just use React, but define its future. We’re moving beyond the basics into the era of automated optimization and AI-native interfaces 🔥&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the heart of Berlin — a city that breathes innovation and underground tech culture — we’re gathering the brightest minds to dissect the inner workings of the most powerful UI library on the planet. The first wave of speakers is out, featuring core contributors, architectural visionaries, and leaders from the world’s top engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;⚡️ 40+ in-depth talks &amp;amp; hands-on workshops&lt;br&gt;
⚡️ 800+ React experts on-site in Berlin&lt;br&gt;
⚡️ 10k+ global attendees online&lt;/p&gt;

