🔹 &lt;strong&gt;React Core &amp;amp; Future:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep dives into the React Compiler (React Forget), fine-grained reactivity, and the evolution of the Reconciliation engine.&lt;br&gt;
🔹 &lt;strong&gt;RSC &amp;amp; Server-First Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastering React Server Components, Server Actions, and hybrid streaming patterns for high-load applications.&lt;br&gt;
🔹 &lt;strong&gt;Performance Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced strategies for hydration, sub-millisecond TBT (Total Blocking Time), and large-scale bundle optimization.&lt;br&gt;
🔹 &lt;strong&gt;Cross-Platform &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt; Pushing the limits of React Native, the New Architecture, and building unified design systems for the 2026 hardware landscape.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Join the React elite in the capital of European tech:&lt;br&gt;
📍 &lt;strong&gt;Berlin &amp;amp; Online&lt;/strong&gt; 🇩🇪&lt;br&gt;
🗓️ &lt;strong&gt;December 4 &amp;amp; 7, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

